-# API Specialist Gate Final Audit: APPROVED for KANBA-162 (Priority #0 Remediation)
-
-- Auditor: arch-reviewer (Swarm Systems/Backend Architect & API Specialist Gate)
-- Worktree: `/tmp/kb-wt-KANBA-162`
-- Branch: `feat/KANBA-162`
